    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0040_select_01",
      "hash64": "8DFCA77950E4BCD8",
      "text": "Director Clavell?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "8DFCAA7950E4C1F1",
      "text": "Clive?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "59AB8202A7EA8494",
      "text": "Like I said before, the name’s Clive. Please don’t\\nforget it.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "59AB8302A7EA8647",
      "text": "Yup, that’s me! Clive, the normal academy\\nstudent.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "59AB8002A7EA812E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Anyway, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]... I owe\\nyou\\r\\none.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "59AB8102A7EA82E1",
      "text": "Thanks to you, I’ve been accepted into\\nOperation Starfall.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "8DFCA97950E4C03E",
      "text": "Why did you join?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0040_select_04",
      "hash64": "8DFCAC7950E4C557",
      "text": "What’s your endgame?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "59AB7E02A7EA7DC8",
      "text": "I need answers, that’s all.\\c\\nHow do I resolve this situation with Team Star...\\nand what’s causing its members’ odd behavior?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0040_select_05",
      "hash64": "8DFCAB7950E4C3A4",
      "text": "What situation?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0040_select_06",
      "hash64": "8DFCAE7950E4C8BD",
      "text": "Odd behavior?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "59AB7F02A7EA7F7B",
      "text": "Team Star is the subject of more than a few nasty\\nrumors swirling around the academy, you know.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "59AB7C02A7EA7A62",
      "text": "Some say their bullying has caused a worrying\\nnumber of students to drop out of school...\\c\\nOthers say they’re holed up in their bases,\\nplotting to cause trouble for the academy.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "59AB7D02A7EA7C15",
      "text": "But these are rumors. The matter I am directly\\nconfronted with is something else...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "59AEEA02A7ED6B23",
      "text": "I’m talking about Team Star’s persistent truancy.\\nThey’ve all been skipping class for a while now...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "59AEE902A7ED6970",
      "text": "Five of them in particular—the so-called “bosses”\\nof Team Star—haven’t so much as set foot inside\\r\\na classroom for over a year.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "59AEEC02A7ED6E89",
      "text": "And it seems the team’s rank and file have\\nrecently started stirring up mischief as well.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "59AEEB02A7ED6CD6",
      "text": "That’s why I took it upon myself to issue a direct\\norder to Team Star to disband.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "59AEEE02A7ED71EF",
      "text": "I informed them that should they refuse, I would\\nhave no choice but to expel all students affiliated\\r\\nwith their team...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "59AEED02A7ED703C",
      "text": "But I’m afraid there’s been no response. And the\\ndeadline I set for them to make their choice\\r\\nbetween dissolution or expulsion is nigh upon us.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "59AEF002A7ED7555",
      "text": "So you see, when I overheard you talking on the\\nphone to Cassiopeia, it couldn’t have come at\\r\\na more crucial time...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0040_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9FA55E86C3AB05B",
      "text": "Ro-to-to-to-to... ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "1B07436709C75031",
      "text": "It’s Cassiopeia. Can you hear me?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_17",
      "hash64": "59AEEF02A7ED73A2",
      "text": "Urk![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_18",
      "hash64": "59AEF202A7ED78BB",
      "text": "*whisper whisper*\\nAnother time, then...\\c\\n*whisper whisper*\\nBe careful...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "1B07406709C74B18",
      "text": "I see you’re coming up to one of Team Star’s\\nbases. Was there...someone with you just now?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0040_select_07",
      "hash64": "8DFCAD7950E4C70A",
      "text": "Nobody",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0040_select_08",
      "hash64": "8DFCA07950E4B0F3",
      "text": "It’s just me",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "1B07416709C74CCB",
      "text": "Well...be warned that Team Star will have its\\nguard up after losing one boss to you already.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "1B07466709C7554A",
      "text": "This base won’t go down as easily as the last one.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "1B07476709C756FD",
      "text": "Proceed with extreme caution. I’ll be in touch.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
